  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When swords went out of fashion, walking-sticks, I suppose, came into fashion.",
      "output_sha256": "bd64d152417366599955fa0359f053396894e65d8242e9b6b8f0fadacd3b931e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "bd64d152417366599955fa0359f053396894e65d8242e9b6b8f0fadacd3b931e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The present custom has its advantages.",
      "output_sha256": "848da84d25b905708aeb02e4e80c26f6194cb3ba379458743bb0c48d39689f52",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "848da84d25b905708aeb02e4e80c26f6194cb3ba379458743bb0c48d39689f52",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Even in his busiest day the hero's sword must have returned at times to its scabbard, and what would he do then with nothing in his right hand?",
      "output_sha256": "f035e2c1a1334d3f3afce728d95ba187b70aa34118f336b981bd16ff3a140521",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "f035e2c1a1334d3f3afce728d95ba187b70aa34118f336b981bd16ff3a140521",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But our walking-sticks have no scabbards.",
      "output_sha256": "3ef2986b39a2d884e267603d8d6f921d8f1344a62ec96a2ac470f2f9f7f869f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "3ef2986b39a2d884e267603d8d6f921d8f1344a62ec96a2ac470f2f9f7f869f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We grasp them always, ready at any moment to summon a cab, to point out a view, or to dig an enemy in the stomach.",
      "output_sha256": "eeb9b6de4620f476bfcf971490c290dbfb1b1db35e3d63842920c10f7cabaa53",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "eeb9b6de4620f476bfcf971490c290dbfb1b1db35e3d63842920c10f7cabaa53",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Amidst this, we brandish them defiantly against the world.",
      "output_sha256": "321920019d7d38c0d6257bbbb4dabc0364852c32652bf4e27f920d0b41e73daf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.355439,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6b1b1b98ef108bdef5004c82440fc60298008a9dfd73d9dbc24a88247d5825d3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "321920019d7d38c0d6257bbbb4dabc0364852c32652bf4e27f920d0b41e73daf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "My first cane was a malacca, adorned with a silver collar and a polished horn handle.",
      "output_sha256": "9b16315aaa3021bcee24873e4f4d1b09fcc645f6c06b51a5cfd3b4c6cb3139ef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.748235,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d1135345aed4b3a67e5dc233b95f8a4ef91f6c40b4db444d24c418ac397c40a5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9b16315aaa3021bcee24873e4f4d1b09fcc645f6c06b51a5cfd3b4c6cb3139ef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "For weeks, it gazed longingly at me from a shop window until a fortunate birthday gift finally allowed me to claim it.",
      "output_sha256": "9dde27bbe2d9cc5195147e6a223bb5fe4e344b57031ad717b8643f628704b026",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.617266,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a85d31364cfd04cda6541d4490f81416973261871487a61d799e2f3633226fd3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9dde27bbe2d9cc5195147e6a223bb5fe4e344b57031ad717b8643f628704b026",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We went back to school together that afternoon, and if anything can lighten the cloud which hangs over the last day of holidays, it is the glory of some such stick as mine.",
      "output_sha256": "ac966e23d395b625a9aaa3a81041e7f8194eb97674d6737bf7bb4550bfbb4312",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "ac966e23d395b625a9aaa3a81041e7f8194eb97674d6737bf7bb4550bfbb4312",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Of course, its beauty was destined to be short-lived, but even in its demise, it retained a certain charm.",
      "output_sha256": "5b89faa5fe2dee60224d312292b4cf21f91323e060ea40a89414cab30688c383",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.297937,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6c058efdba019a0ead971a6fe67cbdf2f3b9862a3de15b22546f21f099c37d65"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5b89faa5fe2dee60224d312292b4cf21f91323e060ea40a89414cab30688c383",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I had left many a parental umbrella in the train unhonoured and unsung.",
      "output_sha256": "3795e049d3773197ee70871c9ea6125edea8dc55fea0600c6371949b27d6b27d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "3795e049d3773197ee70871c9ea6125edea8dc55fea0600c6371949b27d6b27d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "My malacca was mislaid in an hotel in Norway.",
      "output_sha256": "7596dc1d996a1ba6bc022eb12e0e9cca66b3b1ab440dab6ae2cab4979cb93a50",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "7596dc1d996a1ba6bc022eb12e0e9cca66b3b1ab440dab6ae2cab4979cb93a50",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "To this day, when the curtains are drawn and we gather by the warm fire, sharing tales of distant adventures, I find myself casually tapping the logs with the poker, nonchalantly mentioning, \"I suppose you didn’t happen to stay at Vossvangen?",
      "output_sha256": "fb5c0dbdf1ae0a8cec287bf00d15c81b6c2464a43558bf3976cfab2eccc7f7b9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.434861,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0c5fb54b8381fda3bf01deb2289e7d4dac3cbbb6788a288941e1ec0e4b0b811a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fb5c0dbdf1ae0a8cec287bf00d15c81b6c2464a43558bf3976cfab2eccc7f7b9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I left a malacca cane there once.",
      "output_sha256": "acbb453a682089f06aa83697632b3143d4bc63c308cb9a602336b3f8878b7a52",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "acbb453a682089f06aa83697632b3143d4bc63c308cb9a602336b3f8878b7a52",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Quite a nice one too.\"",
      "output_sha256": "0b478ddc1e9a4c6184890e5aed29691e70ddf39198cf3f693961c7d63f0225f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.57,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "41bf0343e1105a1df6984d5082b0f354c131ef8d4f64ff643cffc732ce0f2bfd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0b478ddc1e9a4c6184890e5aed29691e70ddf39198cf3f693961c7d63f0225f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "So that there is an impression among my friends that there is hardly a town in Europe but has had its legacy from me.",
      "output_sha256": "66b5a0c5e9aef8d11231c366e8d602330ca26cbfc30eb34e0f236644c1e5c025",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "66b5a0c5e9aef8d11231c366e8d602330ca26cbfc30eb34e0f236644c1e5c025",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And this I owe to my stick.",
      "output_sha256": "5ba6458fe9cfc75628b278e0ac724b3c4a7bcda29e37e9998d6424fe24c5a58f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "5ba6458fe9cfc75628b278e0ac724b3c4a7bcda29e37e9998d6424fe24c5a58f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "My last is of ebony, ivory-topped.",
      "output_sha256": "3c800e4dc4d2f3941b655c24d86309710757b4c028c66af51204b846ad05edce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "3c800e4dc4d2f3941b655c24d86309710757b4c028c66af51204b846ad05edce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Even though I should spend another fortnight abroad I could not take this stick with me.",
      "output_sha256": "7cc4520076f8bc60f7cde2f6915e19dea4086c2bb7f5a7a5b73a8dc89239b072",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "7cc4520076f8bc60f7cde2f6915e19dea4086c2bb7f5a7a5b73a8dc89239b072",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is not a stick for the country; its heart is in Piccadilly.",
      "output_sha256": "8746343950dbcbb1f67ba579c056a69ae47cb08394bed7d4fcae1fb1c59437dc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "8746343950dbcbb1f67ba579c056a69ae47cb08394bed7d4fcae1fb1c59437dc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Perhaps it could survive a journey to Paris, provided it could withstand the ocean voyage.",
      "output_sha256": "5d3adda30f1ff895213f027b611c3c7e8c9ae0f575689589941f220f3f978cfc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.540641,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5f3698c1e143837bfec43a8551a3d9c7a1ab605405a6a70b0bcce1235b4d37dc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5d3adda30f1ff895213f027b611c3c7e8c9ae0f575689589941f220f3f978cfc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, I cannot envision it crossing the Channel; I feel inadequate in a cap by its side.",
      "output_sha256": "c5e0f82a2d520602542d78a6c9a6b7acee5b9c0e74c38c0eb2fd5d11099433f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.529292,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5fb622944904ae3ba7d93e348876e1207d8af91fd7ea70049d19f326285affc0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c5e0f82a2d520602542d78a6c9a6b7acee5b9c0e74c38c0eb2fd5d11099433f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If I could step onto the boat wearing a silk hat and then retreat below decks, that might be different, but I often feel unwell below, which would not suit its elegance.",
      "output_sha256": "b5e9bedb20d2ca31170a4aeae81a68dbf736597ce7f771eb4ad10e0be1d69b50",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.575435,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8baad8b6f46fef6558c007176f935234aa2d68ce8fa45f650f7f1018f0a00894"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b5e9bedb20d2ca31170a4aeae81a68dbf736597ce7f771eb4ad10e0be1d69b50",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It stands now in a corner of my room crying aloud to be taken to the opera.",
      "output_sha256": "083816e5dbdeb033d0dbd2cd9559a8ee9c02baffd218667d9d3d0feff3bc3f28",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "083816e5dbdeb033d0dbd2cd9559a8ee9c02baffd218667d9d3d0feff3bc3f28",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I used to dislike men who took canes to Covent Garden, but I see now how it must have been with them.",
      "output_sha256": "c2be965b433348b3c7378a1bceae95f23899b007139b8eebb14982bfca88c4dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "c2be965b433348b3c7378a1bceae95f23899b007139b8eebb14982bfca88c4dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "An ebony stick with an ivory top demands a certain level of respect.",
      "output_sha256": "8da30b1031425a27b9f7b1d6ef5d9dd097a0ed54f5761e8f2105a9d58ac6b918",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.489498,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6d575fd6e17d24b1b0e069a8540adfc0bb332a979899f8896ea9059cab5e77e9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8da30b1031425a27b9f7b1d6ef5d9dd097a0ed54f5761e8f2105a9d58ac6b918",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Already I am considering a silk-lined cape, and it is settled that my gloves are to have black stitchings.",
      "output_sha256": "34be4244ece1ac58ed3a7211a0f9886c82865dfc0f55058d19b51a512f753b9c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "34be4244ece1ac58ed3a7211a0f9886c82865dfc0f55058d19b51a512f753b9c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Such is my last stick, for it was given to me this very morning.",
      "output_sha256": "0b5eb3fe321fd2d9a768136219f6689d2c57fa82e48feb6950e33824bf636c08",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "0b5eb3fe321fd2d9a768136219f6689d2c57fa82e48feb6950e33824bf636c08",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "At my first sight of it I thought that it might replace the common one which I lost in an Easter train.",
      "output_sha256": "da3f7e561d66ffd5f71f571b6f52a9ed8c5e5502532e38a3d7d5c1574d647a13",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "da3f7e561d66ffd5f71f571b6f52a9ed8c5e5502532e38a3d7d5c1574d647a13",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That was silly of me.",
      "output_sha256": "50c5a5ebe5f32714e7f7a1d3483a3858b65fbda6103e9fbc0f51933363ba3675",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "50c5a5ebe5f32714e7f7a1d3483a3858b65fbda6103e9fbc0f51933363ba3675",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I must have a stick of less gentle birth which is not afraid to be seen with a soft hat.",
      "output_sha256": "213489c9676d0f8db999ef291d0984827876846b7925d31cf819b65dbb564d18",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "213489c9676d0f8db999ef291d0984827876846b7925d31cf819b65dbb564d18",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It must be a stick which I can drop, or on occasion kick; one with which I can slash dandelions; one for which, when ultimately I leave it in a train, conscience does not drag me to Scotland Yard.",
      "output_sha256": "2d282c77d3b42038f9f5641d3c1288adc896b7ed5ae142efe7dc98bdfec22147",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "2d282c77d3b42038f9f5641d3c1288adc896b7ed5ae142efe7dc98bdfec22147",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In short, a companionable stick for a day's journey; a country stick.",
      "output_sha256": "7f701fbef9bfeafc98c3d8ed6527cde1004c223c96157ba26f8edeb1b4a1279f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "7f701fbef9bfeafc98c3d8ed6527cde1004c223c96157ba26f8edeb1b4a1279f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The quest for the ideal country stick is a challenging one.",
      "output_sha256": "71961d92ff1a1f178341f0b76a7aed8f9a148bdc0c85aa00640c37668fe269c0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.484928,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "56d631f3f168d0e40947efa36eeb5ac032f1267fbf8305326f2f36981943d008"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "71961d92ff1a1f178341f0b76a7aed8f9a148bdc0c85aa00640c37668fe269c0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It must be thick enough to stand much rough usage of a sort which I will explain presently, and yet it must be thin so that it makes a pleasant whistling sound through the air.",
      "output_sha256": "52651074c2321a7cea043db2db2de11fc96034c62c2304394ae7127471a21d08",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "52651074c2321a7cea043db2db2de11fc96034c62c2304394ae7127471a21d08",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Its handle must be curved so that it can pull down the spray of blossom of which you are in need, or pull up the luncheon basket which you want even more badly, and yet it must be straight so that you can drive an old golf ball with it.",
      "output_sha256": "6f56ac1572bee5a1395ffcb92836cc7f97d46b1013fbdf8859462a3e1b170ba1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "6f56ac1572bee5a1395ffcb92836cc7f97d46b1013fbdf8859462a3e1b170ba1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It should lack embellishments to avoid being ostentatious, yet have a band that allows for a score count when I throw stones at it.",
      "output_sha256": "bf1e71fee61f8f4b3f371ce0a425c744c601acb3daa50fd6db2d89a85a3e53f3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.472838,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2297978828ad18d3fa3bb943838c35c0d1b7e925fc11df724899adf0617f807a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bf1e71fee61f8f4b3f371ce0a425c744c601acb3daa50fd6db2d89a85a3e53f3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "You begin to realize how elusive the perfect stick truly is.",
      "output_sha256": "517d704da9139cb780c26c980468c4a402351de543ee408aaf10f76f7ec4d9e4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.601731,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "791a2bd5b819af3244225a86490eb2c4a0adf85f1c4c8ff92e5d96ead78b05f4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "517d704da9139cb780c26c980468c4a402351de543ee408aaf10f76f7ec4d9e4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I suppose we must all concede certain features that our personal sticks may do without.",
      "output_sha256": "d4cb3644381bae6380774ae2ac31e64adaad55b773e49bb8c03e99cf95067ea0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.287615,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "15529307148bf61879ff4848a4eac819e2952b2c6cf0da5da14bca6628924e17"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d4cb3644381bae6380774ae2ac31e64adaad55b773e49bb8c03e99cf95067ea0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For myself I insist on this—my stick must be good for hitting and good to hit with.",
      "output_sha256": "dc840ff9902a40c3d4bd7f63f511d54015ed47fdf00406db99f125651dcf3041",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "dc840ff9902a40c3d4bd7f63f511d54015ed47fdf00406db99f125651dcf3041",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A stick, we are agreed, is something to have in the hand when walking.",
      "output_sha256": "fa5448955e4c9a7260b9621d6714acaca61e4d85ad05291cd04490d165b46ed4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "fa5448955e4c9a7260b9621d6714acaca61e4d85ad05291cd04490d165b46ed4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But there are times when we sit down; and if our journey shall have taken us to the beach, our stick must at once be propped in the sand while from a suitable distance we throw stones at it.",
      "output_sha256": "e81ab26159ce93065fec7a58a2955dc271fdbf1184714ab9d6288f6e2ddc156a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "e81ab26159ce93065fec7a58a2955dc271fdbf1184714ab9d6288f6e2ddc156a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "However beautiful the sea, its beauty can only be appreciated properly in this fashion.",
      "output_sha256": "b0c3e903077fc9f9e36c4c93aad60abb19b104d9c0320ce238723118430cff1b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "b0c3e903077fc9f9e36c4c93aad60abb19b104d9c0320ce238723118430cff1b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Scenery must not be taken at a gulp; we must absorb it unconsciously.",
      "output_sha256": "a140f189a5e83a68ee48da76cb965e3f03659997727127865ce8455fe3e08a60",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "a140f189a5e83a68ee48da76cb965e3f03659997727127865ce8455fe3e08a60",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "As we contemplate whether a shot at the band scores a two or merely a one just below, with our arms engaged in the act of throwing, we become ideally open to the beauty surrounding us.",
      "output_sha256": "a5bd4ce02828debb2582ad4502a596b07f425063276a3a864781078f6a4c94e4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.423374,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9713d57b6d2a502552bc4c688b58f7eb0af6084af4ce2b57b4372812bcc83e58"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a5bd4ce02828debb2582ad4502a596b07f425063276a3a864781078f6a4c94e4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Moreover, for my country stick, it is essential that I can grasp it by the wrong end and still strike a ball.",
      "output_sha256": "75c377bda4741f53a92d179f848701da110b2d2c3ea9de2320a804c37185965e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.571731,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "916f047008907152c3410f33835568ba1ee1f9c3b7ef75b32b91267ef562546b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "75c377bda4741f53a92d179f848701da110b2d2c3ea9de2320a804c37185965e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Thus, it should have no ferrule, and the handle must be heavy and straight.",
      "output_sha256": "830282ef8ec982475a3f5eb3a0252648ff4899c041ac197f07bf612886b92970",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.810714,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "181ea04b6775a326b21da3583571dce16c0258650ca58bb71a66c084da16f9e8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "830282ef8ec982475a3f5eb3a0252648ff4899c041ac197f07bf612886b92970",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This is how golf came to be; its originator wandered the fields after a picnic lunch, playfully batting the cork from his bottle.",
      "output_sha256": "913cb908bb8c44461d4afe7a693757f47da63aa24ddca12c57e59aedba119493",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.561831,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b6a6d3e84beb26c4c5e1eadada2470568b496dced99e1d085845ce85d3c4da20"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_ai_sha256": "913cb908bb8c44461d4afe7a693757f47da63aa24ddca12c57e59aedba119493",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "At first he took seventy-nine from the gate in one field to the oak tree in the next; afterwards fifty-four.",
      "output_sha256": "cdfef448245344590f502eecbc7cf251839f4f0b675b186ed40813a2e373f499",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "cdfef448245344590f502eecbc7cf251839f4f0b675b186ed40813a2e373f499",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Then suddenly he saw the game.",
      "output_sha256": "e021ffa32a068303a73ce2a493d3f7e1d83c43cb5251fd4a695a7ccfad20a85c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "e021ffa32a068303a73ce2a493d3f7e1d83c43cb5251fd4a695a7ccfad20a85c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "We cannot claim he lacked a love for Nature.",
      "output_sha256": "75480b2d4df72cec187f3227b63198e61103e1648519889d934dd2b2881038f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.494474,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "38ca43f4b817402b62f53114060d5d67943459595fdf1be9c8f18dee5a4fd99f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "75480b2d4df72cec187f3227b63198e61103e1648519889d934dd2b2881038f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The desire to knock a ball about, to play silly games with a stick, comes upon a man most keenly when he is happy; let it be ascribed that he is happy to the streams and the hedges and the sunlight through the trees.",
      "output_sha256": "11146d1d6d005b2e5c1f2da5fe108826f272dbdfbb7ff3f42e95883b0bc6faba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "11146d1d6d005b2e5c1f2da5fe108826f272dbdfbb7ff3f42e95883b0bc6faba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And so let my stick have a handle heavy and straight, and let there be no ferrule on the end.",
      "output_sha256": "3b988e5fbe8c773157f6ffc33f687830bd385e9fdf896828bbb49bffb055b2e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "3b988e5fbe8c773157f6ffc33f687830bd385e9fdf896828bbb49bffb055b2e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Be sure that I have an old golf ball in my pocket.",
      "output_sha256": "5060ca42e8bfd604beb5d72a6dd4af6eb53cb09651460d80292bb1e5148441e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "5060ca42e8bfd604beb5d72a6dd4af6eb53cb09651460d80292bb1e5148441e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In London one is not so particular.",
      "output_sha256": "d26e21f886458b5d6d68795758ec81b209f92c016547a7436105c90762c24b97",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "d26e21f886458b5d6d68795758ec81b209f92c016547a7436105c90762c24b97",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Chiefly we want a stick for leaning on when we are talking to an acquaintance suddenly met.",
      "output_sha256": "7c7c86d4efea2af795da0b13c69763158d1265e6f546ad06d22a1aa73991b8f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c7c86d4efea2af795da0b13c69763158d1265e6f546ad06d22a1aa73991b8f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Following the initial greeting, and upon realizing we have little else of significance to share, the presence of our stick alleviates the awkwardness.",
      "output_sha256": "ea7cf1ce0783ff567f1a2415a4d949b242821babce76fdd20e751dd9f2906b7e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.425501,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b733b5bb447f259e66acff05e8706aaea0e77d627a2cdb3506ec969db1d840ff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ea7cf1ce0783ff567f1a2415a4d949b242821babce76fdd20e751dd9f2906b7e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It gives us a support moral and physical, such as is supplied in a drawing-room by a cigarette.",
      "output_sha256": "dfb581a6aa8abcf3f4648766897679291314eddca432a6eb33196404404f989f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "dfb581a6aa8abcf3f4648766897679291314eddca432a6eb33196404404f989f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For this purpose size and shape are immaterial.",
      "output_sha256": "75aa015a648a7eb0e8b4239b870d80aaa32f057608876495069afa5ee106b4dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "75aa015a648a7eb0e8b4239b870d80aaa32f057608876495069afa5ee106b4dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yet this much is essential—it must not be too slippery, or in our nervousness we may drop it altogether.",
      "output_sha256": "2441a794cedec047f76568e6cbf655c4a362d73fbc966af2874ed0b537a1fbe5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "2441a794cedec047f76568e6cbf655c4a362d73fbc966af2874ed0b537a1fbe5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "My ebony stick with the polished ivory top—",
      "output_sha256": "e74e35151cfa7931097be80b655480e44eb2deb236b2b33fe15d98e32fd57409",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "e74e35151cfa7931097be80b655480e44eb2deb236b2b33fe15d98e32fd57409",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, I’ve already concluded that this ebony stick feels out of place with my everyday hat.",
      "output_sha256": "52364e1eb3f6c8195bd14378350559f439f05f1f103668c48305e6717de416e8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": 0.635963,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b049ab94e87cc0aadb644a11f267818b17379c0d685e03ef550f0d62439f47b0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_ai_sha256": "52364e1eb3f6c8195bd14378350559f439f05f1f103668c48305e6717de416e8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It stands in its corner waiting for the opera season, I must get another stick for rough work.",
      "output_sha256": "3d650f154febfb6fe000827a23f817d204d8d151a80a717362f3314e5ba11f69",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "3d650f154febfb6fe000827a23f817d204d8d151a80a717362f3314e5ba11f69",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
